[SIZE=5][B]Thanks[/B][/SIZE]
To everyone testing RIPPS2 on Discord: ripto, nuno6573, zackcage6, eliminator1403, FifthFox, Mr.sus.60, lukeatmynose, ahavasi and whoever joins you next. To Berion for the APA check, and to everyone opening issues on GitHub, DarkNerdShawny first (v1.1.7's FreeMcBoot fix came from one): an issue is the best way to get RIPPS2 updated, so be like them and [URL='https://github.com/akilluminati47/RIPPS2/issues']open one[/URL]. Special thanks to all the YouTube love as well: glad to help however you reach me. RIPPS2 is built on RiptOPL by NathanNeurotic and Open PS2 Loader, with Neutrino by rickgaiser, POPSTARTER by krHACKen, Ember by Gageformer, PS2BBL by El_isra and xeRAbora by hacan359.
Made by akilluminati47, built with Claude.

It is a beta: keep your usual loader close by, and tell us what breaks, here, on [URL='https://github.com/akilluminati47/RIPPS2/issues']GitHub issues[/URL], or in #RIPPS2 on the developers' Discord ([URL='https://discord.gg/ggkCDWqhE']discord.gg/ggkCDWqhE[/URL]). Feedback is what makes RIPPS2.

